ls-outlined text-base\">hourglass_empty</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-1\">\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-outline truncate\">Tech Sign-Off</p>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">Pending test hold</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Step 7: Verified (Pending) -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest/60 p-space-sm rounded shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between opacity-75\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-outline\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm font-medium\">07. VERIFIED</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-base\">lock</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-1\">\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-outline truncate\">QA Ops Stamp</p>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">E. Rostova digital sig</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Main Deep Inspection Two-Column Workspace -->\n<div class=\"p-space-lg grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg\">\n<!-- LEFT COLUMN: 60% Width (7 of 12 cols on desktop) -->\n<div class=\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-space-lg\">\n<!-- 1. Problem Description & Telemetry Snapshot Card -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-md\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl\">analytics</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-semibold\">Incident Telemetry &amp; Diagnosis</h2>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-code-data text-code-data bg-error-container text-on-error-container px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded font-bold\">\n            FAULT: HYD-ERR-4402\n          </span>\n</div>\n<!-- Telemetry Graphs and Alert Banner -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded flex flex-col gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Root Failure Mode</span>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface mt-0.5\">\n                Main accumulator line pressure collapse: <span class=\"font-code-data font-semibold text-error\">160 bar → 28 bar in 180s</span>. Servo proportional spool stuck at 42% stroke.\n              </p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-error text-2xl\">warning</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Sparkline telemetry strip -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-space-sm pt-space-xs\">\n<!-- Metric 1: Hydraulic Pressure (Steep Drop) -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-outline\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\">CIRCUIT PSI</span>\n<span class=\"font-code-data text-code-data text-error font-bold\">-82.5%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-2\">\n<!-- SVG Sparkline: Steep drop -->\n<svg class=\"w-full h-8 text-error stroke-current fill-none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 28\">\n<path d=\"M0,4 L20,5 L35,6 L45,5 L52,22 L65,24 L80,25 L100,26\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-baseline font-code-data\">\n<span class=\"text-on-surface font-semibold text-body-md\">406 PSI</span>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm text-outline line-through\">2320 PSI</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Metric 2: Oil Temp (Normal) -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-outline\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold\">CORE TEMP</span>\n<span class=\"font-code-data text-code-data text-primary font-bold\">NOMINAL</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-2\">\n<!-- SVG Sparkline: Stable -->\n<svg class=\"w-full h-8 text-primary stroke-current fill-none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 28\">\n<path d=\"M0,15 L15,14 L30,16 L45,15 L60,14 L7